# Base URL of the Baking-Lyrics backend API (copy this file to .env.local to override).
# Defaults to /api/v1 on the same origin. In development Vite proxies /api to
# http://localhost:9090 (see vite.config.js). Production builds set it to the
# backend's AWS Lambda Function URL plus /api/v1 (a Vercel project variable);
# the backend must list the site's origin in ALLOWED_ORIGINS for CORS.
# VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
